[2026-01-29T23:30:24.771Z] [STDOUT] {"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-5-20251101","id":"msg_019DrAjRoLYJoRtyxWtQgxMP","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Now I'll complete the evaluation and propose improvements. Based on my analysis:\n\n---\n\n## EVALUATION: NVIDIA Q4 2025 Earnings Research (test_04_financial)\n\n### Does This Change Decisions? **NO** (Mock data, but framework evaluation follows)\n\n### Scores\n\n| Dimension | Score | Evidence |\n|-----------|-------|----------|\n| Insight Density | 2/5 | Findings are template-generated placeholders. \"Apple: Market Cap: $1.2T\" as a finding for NVIDIA research. Generic \"forecasts indicate X could achieve Y\" with no reasoning. |\n| Decision Relevance | 2/5 | No decision summary visible (implementation exists but not in output). Findings don't answer \"should I invest in NVIDIA?\" |\n| Expert Depth | 2/5 | All 5 perspectives have identical boilerplate analysis text. Short seller doesn't provide specific bear case with probability/triggers/kill signals. |\n| Honest Assessment | 1/5 | No contrarian view, no bear case probability, no kill criteria visible in output. All perspectives say the same generic things. |\n| Actionability | 2/5 | Generic \"market consolidation expected\" predictions with shallow rationales. No specific price targets, position sizing, or entry/exit criteria. |\n\n### Overall: 9/25 (36%)\n\n### What This Research Got Right\n1. **Structure exists** - Decision summary function implemented in `report_interactive.py:209-326`\n2. **Bear case prompt enhanced** - `base.py:183-198` has detailed MANDATORY BEAR CASE section\n3. **Kill criteria function exists** - `financial.py:451-525` has `generate_kill_criteria()` method\n4. **Ecosystem analysis function exists** - `financial.py:527-582` has `generate_ecosystem_analysis()` method\n5. **Intent classification** - `input.py` has intent field with get_intent_config()\n\n### What This Research Missed\n1. **Decision Summary not rendering** - The HTML output doesn't show the decision summary, suggesting template mismatch or missing invocation\n2. **Bear case not surfaced** - Despite enhanced prompts, the short_seller perspective has generic text identical to others\n3. **Kill criteria not in report** - Function exists but not rendered in HTML output\n4. **Ecosystem analysis not visible** - Customer/competitor data not extracted or displayed\n5. **Analysis field empty** - Findings lack the \"expert_interpretation\" that explains WHY a finding matters\n6. **Predictions lack depth** - Rationales are 1-sentence boilerplate, missing supporting evidence and what-could-change-this\n\n### If I Were the Requestor, I'd Still Want to Know\n1. Should I buy NVIDIA at current prices?\n2. What's the downside scenario and probability?\n3. What specific signals would tell me to exit?\n4. How dependent is NVIDIA on Microsoft/Google/Amazon capex?\n5. What are analysts actually saying (specific names, targets)?\n\n---\n\nNow let me propose 10 improvements:"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":302,"cache_read_input_tokens":119322,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":302},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"05d3e4f1-2259-4f3e-a055-8040a34c8b02","uuid":"045aaf50-292d-427a-9fbe-e5475dffaa74"}
